    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short fishing game early in development :-). Collect fish population samples for WDOE as you rebuild a once great public transportation network with the help of your new REALLY REALLY cool bird friends. Also unlock a bunch of new areas, fishing rods and upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new fishing rods with unique visuals and abilites<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/66a53ff7b21bda579b777b82c01b0677.poster.avif?t=1750228023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/66a53ff7b21bda579b777b82c01b0677.webm?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/66a53ff7b21bda579b777b82c01b0677.mp4?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch neat fish<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/d2e627972723184c923978319d1da5bf.poster.avif?t=1750228023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/d2e627972723184c923978319d1da5bf.webm?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/d2e627972723184c923978319d1da5bf.mp4?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fishing rod loadout with active and passive upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/036488a37b726a69e24d95488969bf87.poster.avif?t=1750228023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/036488a37b726a69e24d95488969bf87.webm?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/036488a37b726a69e24d95488969bf87.mp4?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with really cool birds </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/deab59569e5aff749e145f622a2b398a.poster.avif?t=1750228023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/deab59569e5aff749e145f622a2b398a.webm?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/deab59569e5aff749e145f622a2b398a.mp4?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rebuild train network and unlock new areas to fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/cd8ad6d014eded65f5d367b3707aab56.poster.avif?t=1750228023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/cd8ad6d014eded65f5d367b3707aab56.webm?t=1750228023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"